{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>וירח</b> Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other וירח ה' את ריח הניחוח. Teaches that the fragrance of Garden of Eden entered with him." "<b>וירח</b> in gematria: it was the day of Passover." "<b>ריח</b> in gematria: the night of Passover." "<b>כריח</b> Two [occurrences]: כריח שדה. כריח שדה לבנון. In the merit of the fragrance of the offering that rises from Lebanon — i.e., the Holy Temple — it stood for him."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:11.439690005Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}